---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const description = 'Not by Design connects analytical systems thinking with the human questions explored through PPE and the humanities.';
---

<BaseLayout title="About" description={description}>
  <article class="prose">
    <header class="entry-header">
      <h1>About this publication</h1>
    </header>

    <p>
      Not by Design connects ways of thinking that are too often kept apart. Technology brings analytical tools for understanding how systems work. The humanities bring attention to human experience, meaning, and moral life. PPE (Philosophy, Politics, and Economics) bridges them, asking how institutions shape our behavior and how we might shape (and optimize) them in turn.
    </p>

    <p>
      Clear thinking about the world's problems needs the full spectrum: causal and analytical rigor, joined with the moral imagination and human understanding the arts can offer. This publication makes room for both. 
    </p>

    <p>
      Ideas here can begin as rough cuts, develop in public, and become releases.
    </p>

    <p>
      The perspective is personal: shaped by deep work in software engineering, technical economics, and doctoral study at George Mason, alongside a lasting love of film criticism and the dream of filmmaking. Not by Design brings those instincts together to understand systems clearly while keeping people in view.
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
